  "visualInspection": [
    "Inspected actual final GLB at all16 study and all16 game headings, eight signed phases per camera and both wireframes. Contact sheets use integer nearest scaling; study2/study14 and engine2/engine14 were also inspected at original224 pixels.",
    "Short wide orange tub, rounded fender shoulders, blue framed windshield, two separate dark blue seats and fixed black cage read as a beach buggy. Front gray lamps and flat vented rear engine cover remain distinct.",
    "Cockpit floor and inner panels are visible between and ahead of the seats in both front and rear obliques. Actual GLB floor rays independently confirm the open recess; no upper deck fills the cockpit.",
    "Four chunky tires sit in open local arch pockets. Far crowns remain beneath broad integrated fenders through both heading sets and signed phases. No exposed-wheel exception is needed.",
    "Cage hoops, roof rails and rear braces remain fixed over the cockpit, clear of tires. Native subpixel tube aliasing varies with angle; no large unsupported gaps or wheel-over-cabin geometry was observed.",
    "Single opaque unlit nearest atlas uses broad warm orange, cool blue and dark ink clusters. No logos, text, PBR, animated equipment or visible driver were introduced. Existing ordinary hidden-driver semantics apply.",
    "Native128/224 full centered crop parity is exact in both cameras/all32 headings, with fixed224/radius112 density. No heading clipping, model fitting or per-angle resizing."
  ],
